      ***************************************************************           
       2500-CONSULTAR-DOMICILIO.                                                
      ***************************************************************           
      * SERVICIO PARA DATOS DOMICILIARIOS                                       
           INITIALIZE WS-X160N315                                               
           INITIALIZE WS-PROVINCIA                                              
           INITIALIZE WS-CODPOSTAL                                              

           MOVE       99999999    TO WS-FAUX-DOMI                               
      * SI TENEMOS INFORMADO EL IDENTIFICADOR DEL DOMICLIO, CONSULTAMOS         
      * EL HISTORICO, POR SI FUE BORRADO, EN CASO CONTRARIO, CONSULTAMOS        
      * CONSULTAMOS LOS DOMICILIOS ACTUALES                                     
           IF WS-KDOMICILIO EQUAL ZEROES OR SPACES                              
              MOVE WS-FECHA             TO X160N315-FECHA-E                     
              MOVE CT-C2                TO X160N315-CMODO-E                     
              MOVE CT-CONSULTA          TO X160N315-PDO-DOMICILIO-CL            
              MOVE X372VT01-KPERSONA1-E TO X160N315-KPERSONA-E                  
           ELSE                                                                 
              MOVE WS-FECHA             TO X160N315-FECHA-E                     
              MOVE CT-H2                TO X160N315-CMODO-E                     
              MOVE CT-HISTORICO         TO X160N315-PDO-DOMICILIO-CL            
              MOVE X372VT01-KPERSONA1-E TO X160N315-KPERSONA-E                  
           END-IF                                                               
           CALL WS-B160N315 USING WS-X160N315                                   
           IF X160N000-CRETORNO-S OF WS-X160N315 NOT = ZEROES                   
      *       SET ERROR-GRAVE            TO TRUE                                
      *       SET NO-ROLLBACK            TO TRUE                                
              MOVE '15'                  TO X372VT01-CRETORNO-S                 
              MOVE 'B372VT01'            TO X372VT01-GNOMPROG-S                 
              MOVE 'ERROR EN LA BUSQUEDA DE DOMICILIO EN LA BBDD.'              
                                         TO X372VT01-GERROR-S                   
           ELSE                                                                 
              IF WS-KDOMICILIO EQUAL ZEROES OR SPACES                           
                 SET NO-INFO-DOM-FISC       TO TRUE                             
                 MOVE ZEROS TO XN-L                                             
                 PERFORM VARYING XN-I FROM 1 BY 1                               
                     UNTIL XN-I > X160N315-DOMICILIOS-OCURRS-S                  
                        OR X160N315-PDO-KDOMICILIO-S(XN-I) = ZEROES             
                        OR X160N315-PDO-KPERSONA-S  (XN-I) = ZEROES             
                        OR SI-INFO-DOM-FISC                                     
      * SI EL DOMICILIO ES DE PRESTACIONES Y NO ES BANCARIO TIENE               
      * PREFERECIA                                                              
                    IF X160N315-PDO-CTIPODOM-S(XN-I) = CT-R                     
                         AND X160N315-PDO-SFISCAL-S(XN-I) NOT = CT-S            
                       MOVE XN-I TO XN-L                                        
                       SET SI-INFO-DOM-FISC TO TRUE                             
                    ELSE                                                        
                       IF X160N315-PDO-CTIPODOM-S(XN-I) = CT-P                  
                          MOVE XN-I TO XN-L                                     
                          SET SI-INFO-DOM-FISC TO TRUE                          
                       END-IF                                                   
                    END-IF                                                      
                 END-PERFORM                                                    
              ELSE                                                              
                 SET NO-INFO-DOM-FISC       TO TRUE                             
                 PERFORM VARYING XN-I FROM 1 BY 1                               
                       UNTIL XN-I > CTE-50                                      
                       OR X160N315-PDO-KDOMICILIO-S(XN-I) = ZEROES              
                       OR X160N315-PDO-KPERSONA-S  (XN-I) = ZEROES              
                    IF WS-KDOMICILIO EQUAL                                      
                         X160N315-PDO-KDOMICILIO-S(XN-I)                        
                         AND X160N315-PDO-FANULACION-S(XN-I) IS NUMERIC         

                       MOVE  X160N315-PDO-FANULACION-S(XN-I) TO WS-FAUX         
      * SI LA FECHA DE ANULACION DEL DOMICILIO QUE ESTAMOS TRATANDO             
      * ES MENOR QUE LA FECHA DE ANULACION DEL DOMICILIO QUE TENEMOS            
      * GUARDADO SE MODIFICA                                                    
                       IF  X372VT01-FECMODIFICA-E  < WS-FAUX                    
                            AND WS-FAUX < WS-FAUX-DOMI                          
                          MOVE WS-FAUX TO WS-FAUX-DOMI                          
                          MOVE XN-I    TO XN-L                                  
                          SET SI-INFO-DOM-FISC TO TRUE                          
                       END-IF                                                   
                    END-IF                                                      
                 END-PERFORM                                                    
              END-IF                                                            
           END-IF                                                               
           IF SW-INFO-DOM-FISC EQUAL 'S'                                        
              MOVE XN-L TO XN-I                                                 
              IF X160N315-PDO-CPAIS-S(XN-I) (1:3) = '011'                       
                  MOVE '011' TO        WS-PAIS                                  
                  MOVE X160N315-PDO-CCODPOST-S(XN-I)  TO   WS-PROVINCIA         
                  MOVE WS-PROVINCIA(1:2)              TO WS-CODPOSTAL           
              ELSE                                                              
                  MOVE '000' TO WS-PAIS                                         
                  MOVE X160N315-PDO-CPAIS-S(XN-I) (1:3) TO WS-PAIS              
                  MOVE '99' TO WS-CODPOSTAL                                     
              END-IF                                                            
      *       INFORMAMOS FORALIDAD                                              
              EVALUATE WS-CODPOSTAL                                             
                  WHEN '01'                                                     
                  WHEN '20'                                                     
                  WHEN '31'                                                     
                  WHEN '48'                                                     
                  WHEN '99'                                                     
                      MOVE WS-CODPOSTAL TO WS-KFORALIDAD                        
                  WHEN OTHER                                                    
                      MOVE '28'         TO WS-KFORALIDAD                        
              END-EVALUATE                                                      
           ELSE                                                                 
              MOVE '16'                  TO X372VT01-CRETORNO-S                 
              MOVE 'B372VT01'            TO X372VT01-GNOMPROG-S                 
              MOVE 'ERROR EN BUSQUEDA DE DOMICILIO FISCAL EN LA BBDD.'          
                                         TO X372VT01-GERROR-S                   
           END-IF                                                               
           .                                                                    
